              "value": "You will be passed a description of a function and array of business functions. Pick the business object function that mostly closely matches the description and return the \"name\" property.  If no good matches, return \"\"\n\ndescription of function: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\narray of business functions: {{$context.$nodes.TEMPDATA.$output.result}}"
